/*
 * Hartwick Atelier — PRODUCT PAGE
 *
 * Rebuilt 16 September 2026 to Aloha's "Product page design and discovery
 * brief" and Hartwick_Product_Desktop_V2.png.
 *
 * The opening is the three-column section `ha-product` (sticky information
 * rail | scrolling photographs | sticky purchase rail), kept from 3 September
 * and extended: serif material line, image count + scroll hint, markers that
 * stay in view, a size that must be chosen, Product JSON-LD restored, and a
 * Delivery row that reads Settings > Policies.
 *
 * Below it, the V2 order: Origin + Process (one record of five stages), The
 * Cloth / Material Record (numbered index and staggered detail photographs),
 * The Master (from the shared master record), Lot Record, Care & Repair /
 * Shipping & Returns, Related Works, then The Register.
 *
 * The compositions the V2 replaced — The Garment, the 13-row Material Record,
 * Authorship, The Origin route, Process, A Wearer's Note, Continue — are
 * DISABLED here, not deleted: their settings and chosen images are intact and
 * any one returns with a single toggle in the theme editor.
 *
 * Content comes from the product's records: hartwick.* first, then the old
 * site's own custom.* / shopify.* fields and the title (Aloha, 16 Sept: "use
 * the existing text and product information from the old Hartwick website").
 * Anything with no source prints a bracketed placeholder and is flagged.
 *
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * NOTE: this file is also written by the Shopify theme editor.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
